# Industrial Safety AR

AR-Based Vocational Training Simulator for Industrial Safety in Jharkhand's Mining & Manufacturing Sector.

SIH 2026

Problem Statement ID: 26041

## Applications

- Worker Android AR Application
- Admin Web Dashboard
- Backend API
- Database

## Core Training Modules

- Fire & Explosion Response
- Gas Leak & Confined Space Safety

